  "content": "[Intro]\n[F]\nI see\n\n[Verse 1]\n[F]trees of green,\n[Am]\n[Bb]red roses too.\n[Am]\n[Gm]I see them bloom\n[F]\n[C#dim]for me and you.\n[Dm]And I\n\n[Chorus]\n[C#]say to myself\n[Bb]What a\n[C]wonderful world.\n[F]\n[C]\nI see\n\n[Verse 2]\n[F]skies of blue\n[Am]\n[Bb]and clouds of white.\n[Am]\n[Gm]Bright sunny days,\n[F]\n[C#dim]dark sacred nights.\n[Dm]And I\n\n[Chorus]\n[C#]think to myself\n[Bb]What a\n[C]wonderful world.\n[F]\nThe\n\n[Bridge]\n[C]colors of the rain\nbow are so\n[F]pretty in the skies.\nAre\n[C]also on the face\nes of\n[F]people walking by.\nI see\n[Dm]friends shaking hands\n[Am]saying\n[Dm]How do you do?\n[Am]\n[Dm]They're really say\n[Am]ing\n[Bb]I love\n[C]you. I see\n\n[Verse 3]\n[F]babies cry,\n[Am]\n[Bb]I watch them grow.\n[Am]\n[Gm]They'll learn much more\n[F]than\n[C#dim]I'll ever know.\n[Dm]And I\n\n[Chorus]\n[C#]think to myself\n[Bb]What a\n[C]wonderful world.\n[F]\n[Eb]\n[D]\nYes, I\n[Bb]think to my-\nself\n[C]What a\nwonderful world.\n[F]\n[Eb]\n[D]\n[F]\n[Eb]\n[D]\nAnd I\n[Bb]say to y-\nself\n[C]What a\nwonderful\n\n[Outro]\n[C#]world.\n[Eb]\n[F]",
